### Quiz questions (use quizId from generate, e.g. 60003)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/quizzes/60003
Authorization: Bearer PasteTokenHere

### Flashcards
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notes/60001/flashcards
Authorization: Bearer PasteTokenHere

### Submit (replace questionIds with the real ones from the GET above)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/quizzes/60003/submit
Authorization: Bearer PasteTokenHere
Content-Type: application/json

{"answers":[
 {"questionId":60018,"selected":"A","confidence":"SURE"},
 {"questionId":60019,"selected":"B","confidence":"SURE"},
 {"questionId":60020,"selected":"C","confidence":"GUESSING"},
 {"questionId":60021,"selected":"B","confidence":"NOT_SURE"},
 {"questionId":60022,"selected":"D","confidence":"SURE"},
 {"questionId":60023,"selected":"B","confidence":"SURE"},
 {"questionId":60024,"selected":"A","confidence":"SURE"},
 {"questionId":60025,"selected":"B","confidence":"NOT_SURE"}
]}

